# NightLife preset
format = 1
name = Loon Lake
author = NightLife
description = A wail over open water. The loon is the only bird among the callers and the thinnest caller in the table -- one recording, eleven usable contours -- so its eight archetypes come from less material than any other's. The space is the largest in the factory set at 0.95 with the damping down at 0.3, because what carries a loon is a lake with a rock shore on the far side.

